TRACK
Ollama:
- Provider/model ID.
- Reported input/output counts.
- Cache information only when supplied.
- Reasoning usage treatment if documented.
- Rate version.
- Peak/off-peak classification where applicable.

Cloudflare:
- Model/settings.
- Reported or calculated documented units.
- Free allowance tracked separately from nominal cost.

Leonardo:
- Actual model/settings/credits.
- Account-specific verified conversion where available.

Deepgram:
- TTS characters.
- STT duration/channels/add-ons.

JSON2Video:
- Actual account billing unit and job usage.
- Do not assume dollars per minute without verification.

R2:
- Storage and operations under the actual account rate.

UNKNOWN COSTS
Use unknown/estimated status.
Never silently treat missing usage or rates as zero.

ACCOUNTING
Separate:
- Estimated cost.
- Reserved allowance.
- Reported usage.
- Settled/reconciled cost.
- Customer credits.
- Promotional provider credits.

Do not count cached tokens twice.
Do not assume unreported cache hits.
Track repair attempts and unsuccessful billable work.

DURABILITY
Atomic reservations and settlement.
Idempotent job accounting.
No process-local Map as the authoritative quota.

ACCEPTANCE
